- [x] Keep the session independent of:
  - [x] `gui.widgets` and component instances;
  - [x] dialogs and console output;
  - [x] filesystem preset storage;
  - [x] `dfhack.gui.revealInDwarfmodeMap()`; and
  - [x] direct world/unit collection.
- [x] Keep Main Window responsible for:
  - [ ] binding component callbacks;
  - [ ] candidate-provider execution and error presentation;
  - [ ] preset load/save adapters and dialogs;
  - [ ] window-settings writes;
  - [ ] zoom/map actions;
  - [ ] refresh dispatch into component APIs; and
  - [ ] drag, resize, render, and global input behavior.
- [x] Preserve `ui_refresh.apply()` ordering or replace it only with a tested,
      equally explicit effect/refresh pipeline.
- [x] Add direct SearchSession tests for every state transition, invalid input,
      result recomputation, sort cycle, and selection-retention rule.
- [x] Reduce Main Window fields and methods after migration; do not leave
      forwarding methods without a host/UI responsibility.

### Phase 4 gate

- [x] Search/filter/scope/sort state can be exercised without constructing a
      widget or faking DFHack GUI classes.
- [x] Main Window is primarily a widget adapter and orchestration boundary.
- [x] Session snapshots do not alias caller-owned tables.
- [x] Persistence and external I/O remain outside the session.
- [x] Direct session tests and broad UI characterization pass.
